export anchor Dependencies:
    description:
        Dependencies are listed under the dependencies property of the
        piton.config.pi file for a project.

        They're specified as a list of URLs with optional properties.

        ```piton
        \\\
        dependencies:
            - https://github.com/piton-lang/piton-rs
                commit: abc
                tag: 1.0
                branch: main
        \\\
        ```
